    {
      "id": "website-6210d4d63542b6612d334863b857dfaf26468dd0-live-data-website",
      "date": "2026-11-06",
      "area": "website",
      "title": "Levels, quests and who is online, updated while members play",
      "notes": [
        "The website now shows members' progress about every 10 minutes while they play with HMC Uploader, not only after a /reload or a logout.",
        "On our PvP realm, the zone where someone is playing shows an hour later; signed-in members still see exact positions on the map right away."
